### =========================================================
###  TBox Restrictions & Disjointness Axioms
### =========================================================

### Axiom: AX_0000  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# PolicyLapse hasExtendedTermEligibility some Coverage
ins:PolicyLapse
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:ExtendedTermEligibility ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ins:Coverage
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Eligibility for extended term insurance after policy lapse. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows that policyholders can elect extended term insurance after lapse, and the property links PolicyLap…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0001  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# InsuredPerson hasDeathBenefitEligibility some DeathBenefit
ins:InsuredPerson
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:DeathBenefitEligibility ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ins:DeathBenefit
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Conditions under which death benefit is payable. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property directly links the insured person to the death benefit payout conditions. Evidence confirms that eligibility depend…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0002  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# ConversionPrivilege hasConversionDeadlineConstraint some RateCapCondition
ins:ConversionPrivilege
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:ConversionDeadlineConstraint ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ins:RateCapCondition
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Time window for conversion after triggering event. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies time limits tied to age and policy expiry, which affect rate structures. The range 'RateCapCondition' i…"@en .

### Axiom: AX_0003  [owl:someValuesFrom]
# AccountValue hasGuaranteedCapRateFloor some RateCapCondition
ins:AccountValue
    rdfs:subClassOf [
        a owl:Restriction ;
        owl:onProperty ins:GuaranteedCapRateFloor ;
        owl:someValuesFrom ins:RateCapCondition
    ] ;
